    "description": "Eight university students who have made it through the hiring process of the major advertising agency “Deneodo” face their final test. Their ultimate challenge: split into two teams-the Government and the Resistance, four members each-and compete in a game to see which side can lead the citizens of a fictional nation into war through the power of advertising.\n\nWho will win? And what is the true purpose behind this final selection? An unpredictable psychological game with a shocking ending that questions the very essence of advertising, the nature of democracy in the digital age, and what “truth” really means.",
